 bounded-int factory and the new config item.\n\n```python\nr = replace_text_batch(\n    \"deepinfer/environ.py\",\n    [\n        {\n            \"old_text\": '''    @staticmethod\n    def int_or_none() -> EnvVar[int | None]:\n        return EnvVar(lambda v: int(v) if v is not None else None)\n''',\n            \"new_text\": '''    @staticmethod\n    def int_or_none() -> EnvVar[int | None]:\n        return EnvVar(lambda v: int(v) if v is not None else None)\n\n    @staticmethod\n    def int_or_none_min(*, minimum: int = 0) -> EnvVar[int | None]:\n        \"\"\"未设置返回 None；设置时按 ``int`` 解析且结果不得小于 ``minimum``。\"\"\"\n\n        def _init(v: str | None) -> int | None:\n            if v is None:\n                return None\n            value = int(v)\n            if value < minimum:\n                raise ValueError(f\"{value!r} must be >= {minimum}\")\n            return value\n\n        return EnvVar(_init)\n''',\n        },\n        {\n            \"old_text\": '''    # -- Logging --\n    DEEPINFER_LOGGING_INTERVAL_STEP = EnvVar.int(default=100)\n''',\n            \"new_text\": '''    # -- Logging --\n    DEEPINFER_LOGGING_INTERVAL_STEP = EnvVar.int(default=100)\n    DEEPINFER_LOG_MAX_MESSAGE_CHARS = EnvVar.int_or_none_min(minimum=32)\n    \"\"\"普通诊断日志消息正文的最大字符数；未设置表示不限长，统计日志始终完整输出。\"\"\"\n''',\n        },\n    ],\n    expected_hash=\"fe2c531989c419f0b51b169a07f5ed826dcec7f95c0c5bc3a351805923c4f218\",\n)\nprint(r)\n```"}]}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Latest execution feedback:\nExecutor output:\nExecution logs:\n{'ok': True, 'path': 'deepinfer/environ.py', 'file_hash': '0082df216071fe181d3d5d4d3aca268ff28c47339eb21479e9c75e7360239eb9', 'before_hash': 'fe2c531989c419f0b51b169a07f5ed826dcec7f95c0c5bc3a351805923c4f218', 'changed': True}\nLast output from code snippet:\nNone\nRecent project tool results:\n[{\"tool\":\"read_range\",\"arguments\":{\"start_line\":1,\"end_line\":31},\"result\":{\"path\":\"deepinfer/environ.py\",\"file_hash\":\"fe2c