{"event": "model_request", "time": 1793847785.0878124, "run_id": "136633a8d46f4c379e4bb81886eb147c", "seq": 207, "number": 14, "body": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Complete the task using the Python tools below.\nBriefly describe the next action, then output ONE fenced Python block and STOP after it.\nExample:\nRead the current progress.\n```python\nprint(task_status())\n```\nDo not emit JSON wrappers, simulated tool output or future conversation turns. Keep the action within the output budget.\n\nCall tools with keyword arguments; arrays are Python lists. Print needed output. Variables and imports persist,\nand successful statements before an error remain executed. Paths are relative to the task repository.\nUse tools for all file/command operations; edit only allowed files, never tests. Use current file_hash as expected_hash.\nImports allowed: ['collections', 'datetime', 'itertools', 'json', 'math', 'queue', 'random', 're', 'stat', 'statistics', 'time', 'unicodedata']; import before use. Read sufficient evidence and avoid repeated unchanged reads.\nWhen the business deliverable is ready, call final_answer: it runs missing current-version verification,\ncompletes the plan on success, or returns the failure for repair. It cannot supply missing reading, baseline or report.\n\nAvailable tools:\n```python\ndef list_files(path: str = None, limit: int = None, offset: int = None) -> dict:\n    'List text files under a repository path.\\npath: {\"type\":\"string\"}\\nlimit: {\"type\":\"integer\"}\\noffset: {\"type\":\"integer\"}'\n\ndef search_code(query: str, paths: list = None, limit: int = None) -> dict:\n    'Search visible text source files for a literal string.\\nquery: {\"type\":\"string\"}\\npaths: {\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"}}\\nlimit: {\"type\":\"integer\"}'\n\ndef read_file(path: str) -> dict:\n    'Read a text file in full. Returns dict: content (text), file_hash, evidence_ids. Read result[\\'content\\'], not result[:N].\\npath: {\"type\":\"string\"}'\n\ndef read_range(path: str, start_line: int, end_line: int) -> dict:\n    'Read an inclusive line range from a text file. Returns dict: content (text), file_hash, evidence_ids.\\npath: {\"type\":\"string\"}\\nstart_line: {\"type\":\"integer\"}\\nend_line: {\"type\":\"integer\"}'\n\ndef read_symbol(path: str, symbol: str) -> dict:\n    'Read a complete Python class or function including decorators. Returns dict: content (text), file_hash, evidence_ids.\\npath: {\"type\":\"string\"}\\nsymbol: {\"type\":\"string\"}'\n\ndef write_file(path: str, content: str, expected_hash: str) -> dict:\n    'Replace an editable text file after checking its current hash.\\npath: {\"type\":\"string\"}\\ncontent: {\"type\":\"string\"}\\nexpected_hash: {\"type\":\"string\"}'\n\ndef replace_text_batch(path: str, edits: list, expected_hash: str) -> dict:\n    'Atomically replace unique nonoverlapping occurrences from one file version. Returns ok, path, before_hash, file_hash, changed.\\npath: {\"type\":\"string\"}\\nedits: {\"type\":\"array\",\"description\":\"Python list of objects, e.g. [{\\'old_text\\':\\'before\\',\\'new_text\\':\\'after\\'}]; all refer to the original file.\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"old_text\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"new_text\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"old_text\",\"new_text\"],\"additionalProperties\":false}}\\nexpected_hash: {\"type\":\"string\"}'\n\ndef run_command(argv: list, cwd: str = None) -> dict:\n    'Run one allowed argv command without a shell. Omit cwd or use \\'.\\' for the task repository root. argv is a Python list[str]. Returns dict: rc, stdout (text), stderr, timed_out.\\nargv: {\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"}}\\ncwd: {\"type\":\"string\"}'\n\ndef update_plan(items: list) -> dict:\n    'Set the task plan; preserve titles/order and update todo/doing/done.\\nitems: {\"type\":\"array\",\"description\":\"List of objects, e.g. [{\\\\\"title\\\\\":\\\\\"Read sources\\\\\",\\\\\"status\\\\\":\\\\\"doing\\\\\"}]. Each status is todo, doing or done; retain existing titles/order.\"}'\n\ndef recall(evidence_ids: list) -> dict:\n    'Queue evidence ids; batches are bounded and overflow remains pending.\\nevidence_ids: {\"type\":\"array\"}'\n\ndef task_status() -> dict:\n    'Show the current plan, remaining reading, notes, changes and verification, plus evidence ids.'\n\ndef write_note(title: str, content: str, evidence_ids: list, section: str = None) -> dict:\n    'Save or update a literal model-written note grounded in exposed evidence. Returns dict: note_id, sources, chars.\\ntitle: {\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"Stable note title; reuse it when updating the same note.\"}\\ncontent: {\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"One contiguous string literal, 20..3000 characters. No adjacent string fragments, concatenation or variable; text must occur verbatim in your response.\"}\\nevidence_ids: {\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"description\":\"Python list[str], e.g. [\\'ev-abc\\'], not a string. Copy ids from delivered Evidence headers.\"}\\nsection: {\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"Optional stable note key; source notes still allow 20..3000 characters.\"}'\n\ndef final_answer(answer: any) -> any:\n    \"\"\"Provides a final answer to the given problem.\n\n    Args:\n        answer: The final answer to the problem\n    \"\"\"\n\n```"}]}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "New task:\n# 题目2：阅读真实源码，完成跨模块日志配置（1分）\n\n使用你在上次实践基础上扩展的 agent，为 DeepInfer 增加一个小功能：**通过环境变量限制普通诊断日志的消息长度，同时让统计日志保持完整**。需要在配置、日志格式化、统计消息消费三个模块间接好这条链路，不要求部署整个推理框架。\n\n本题使用固定提交 `774ce244b87cc0eb8d4b94ab9f5de2ab22049f01` 的完整官方源码，来源见 [材料说明](来源与许可.md)。长上下文来自真实代码仓库：agent 需要检索不同文件、保留相关代码的含义，并据此完成跨文件修改。不是读到一个函数后单独改它，也不要求通读整个仓库或发送所有无关代码。\n\n## 功能目标与例子\n\n**环境变量**是进程启动时可以读取的字符串配置。**日志处理器（handler）**是终端、文件等输出渠道；**格式化器（formatter）**负责把日志记录转成文字。同一条 **LogRecord（日志记录对象）**可以交给多个处理器。\n\n新增环境变量 `DEEPINFER_LOG_MAX_MESSAGE_CHARS`。例如将它设为 `64` 后，默认处理器输出的普通诊断消息最多保留64字符；统计模块从队列输出的完整指标不受这个限制。未设置变量时，输出保持原样。\n\n这是业务源码中的配置，不是给自己的 agent 新增命令行参数，也不是模型 API 的 token 上限。课程测试会自行设置它，运行评测命令前不必手动设置。\n\n### 1. 配置读取与刷新\n\n在 `deepinfer/environ.py` 的集中配置中加入同名属性，遵循现有配置描述符的读取和缓存机制。**描述符**是控制属性读取行为的对象；这里首次访问配置时读取环境变量，之后使用缓存。\n\n- 未设置时，属性值为 `None`，表示不限长。\n- 设置时，按 Python 的 `int` 解析，结果须大于等于32。空串、不能解析的字符串或小于32的值抛出 `ValueError`；错误文字须包含变量名，便于定位。\n- 第一次访问后保持缓存。只修改系统环境变量，不应立即改变已有配置值。\n- 使用原有的单项刷新或全部刷新机制后，下次读取才重新解析。重新执行默认日志初始化时，将当时的配置值应用到新的格式化器；已创建的旧格式化器保留原预算。\n\n例如先读取 `32`，再把环境变量改成 `64`，重新初始化日志仍使用缓存的32；先刷新这项配置、再重新初始化日志，才改为64。无需让运行中的所有处理器自动刷新。\n\n### 2. 普通日志的长度预算\n\n在 `deepinfer/logger.py` 中扩展 `NewLineFormatter`，并让默认日志初始化读取上述配置。\n\n1. 保留原有四个位置参数，新参数 `max_message_chars` 只能按名称传入。默认 `None` 表示不限长；其他值须为大于等于32的整数，布尔值不算整数，否则抛出 `ValueError`。\n2. 先完成 `%s` 等参数替换，再计算消息长度。预算只限制消息正文，不包含时间、级别等前缀、异常回溯或 `stack_info`（调用栈文字）。\n3. 用 Python 的 `len` 和字符串切片计数。中文、表情、换行也计数；不要求保护组合字符或整个表情序列。\n4. 消息不超过预算时保持原样。超出时，用固定标记 `...<omitted>...` 替换中间内容，标记计入预算。剩余空间为“预算减去标记长度”，开头保留向上取整的一半，末尾保留其余部分，拼成“开头、标记、末尾”。例如预算32时，保留开头9字符、末尾8字符，加上15字符标记。\n5. 沿用原有多行前缀、时间精度、颜色及异常处理。不能改写共享原记录的 `msg`、`args`、`exc_info`、`stack_info`；同一记录随后交给完整处理器，仍须保留完整消息。\n6. 默认处理器使用集中配置；重复初始化不能重复添加处理器。独立创建格式化器时，未传新参数仍表示不限长，不自行读取环境变量。\n7. 如果记录的 `keep_full_message` 属性**恰好是 `True`**，完整保留消息；`1`、字符串等其他值不能代替 `True`。\n\n### 3. 统计日志的完整输出\n\n在 `deepinfer/engine/stats_logger.py` 中找到真正消费日志队列并输出消息的位置。通过 Python logging 的 `extra` 字段，为每条统计消息附加 `keep_full_message=True`，让默认处理器保留其完整内容。\n\n`extra` 用于给当前日志记录添加属性，不是给整份日志模块关闭预算。普通诊断日志仍须限长。保留原来的消息队列、批量消息顺序、结束信号、等待和异常处理，不要直接打印消息、清空队列或重写统计计算。\n\n## 阅读与上下文要求\n\n允许修改的三个文件如下。表中按职责给出阅读范围；具体函数位置由 agent 自己检索。\n\n| 文件 | 首次修改前需要读入模型的原始代码 | 为什么需要 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `deepinfer/environ.py` | 完整配置描述符类，以及单项刷新、全部刷新函数 | 确认首次读取、缓存、错误包装和刷新怎样协作；新配置不能绕开原机制 |\n| `deepinfer/logger.py` | 完整格式化器类、默认日志初始化函数、获取日志对象的函数 | 确认预算如何接入真实输出，且不影响旧接口、其他处理器及异常信息 |\n| `deepinfer/engine/stats_logger.py` | 日志模块的导入和日志对象初始化，以及完整队列投递、消费函数 | 确认统计消息经过哪条路径输出，找到应添加记录属性的位置 |\n\n三个文件全文合计约3.4万字符，仓库中还有其他源码；相关片段通常更短。评测**不按阅读字数或请求次数多少加分**，也不要求一定分多次调用模型。关键是能从较长代码中找到必要信息，修改时仍能利用它，并让三个模块共同工作。模型收到源码不等于已经理解，最终还要通过功能测试。\n\n第一次写入前，先用自己的文件工具完整读取三个初始文件，**每个文件各保存一条完整的 `file_read` 记录，`content` 为该文件全文**，供补丁和过程核对；只记录片段不能替代这条初始记录。**不要求把全文同时发给模型**，上表所需代码可以分块进入不同请求。产生首次修改决定的请求，要保留这些原文，或复用模型依据它们生成的笔记。只把原文写入日志、没有实际送入模型，不能通过阅读检查。\n\n分块时以表中要求的完整类、完整函数或独立调用为单位：每个单位须在一次请求中完整发送，不同单位可以分到不同请求。这样既能控制上下文大小，也能让模型看到一个机制的完整实现。\n\n可以直接保留原文，不新增笔记事件。若用笔记替换原文，记录以下可选事件，并在后续修改请求中复用模型实际返回的文字：\n\n```json\n{\"event\":\"context_note\",\"sources\":[\"deepinfer/environ.py\",\"deepinfer/logger.py\"],\"content\":\"这里记录模型依据已收到的真实源码返回的笔记，之后在修改请求中复用\"}\n```\n\n`sources` 为来源路径数组，`content` 为20～3000字符；可以一份跨文件笔记，也可多份。先让模型阅读对应原文并生成笔记，再记录、复用，不能在修改决定之后补记。细节见 [日志规范](../../说明/日志与产物规范.md)。\n\n### 可选的源码读取工具\n\n可继续使用自己的分段读取工具，也可让 agent 在本轮工作副本根目录调用 `read_source.py`：\n\n```bash\n# 搜索配置相关代码；返回匹配行前最多3行及后续原文\npython read_source.py --file deepinfer/environ.py --search \"Logging\" --lines 15\n\n# 定位某类日志调用，再按需要补读周围的完整函数\npython read_source.py --file deepinfer/engine/stats_logger.py --search \"logger.info\" --lines 15\n\n# 已找到位置时按行读取；行号从1起算\npython read_source.py --file deepinfer/logger.py --start-line 1 --lines 100\n```\n\n| 参数 | 含义 |\n|---|---|\n| `--file` | 必填，工作副本内的相对文件路径，不填其他目录或绝对路径 |\n| `--search` | 可选，原样、区分大小写搜索，最多返回前5处匹配；与 `--start-line` 不能同时使用 |\n| `--start-line` | 可选，包含起始行；未提供搜索和行号时从第1行开始 |\n| `--lines` | 每段最多返回的行数，默认40，允许1～120，不超过文件末尾 |\n\n成功返回 JSON：`path` 为实际路径，`total_lines` 为总行数，`ranges` 中每项包含 `start_line`、`end_line` 和原始 `content`。搜索还返回 `total_matches` 和 `more_matches`；未找到时 `ranges` 为空。结果超过12,000字符时退出2，请减少行数或缩小关键词。\n\n工具只读源码，不总结、不改代码、不调用模型。使用时在 `command_result` 中保留实际参数数组、工作目录、退出码和完整 JSON。其他命令的检索结果可保留，但用作阅读证据的代码须另以 `file_read` 记录原文。\n\n## 修改范围与开发记录\n\n只修改上表三个文件，三个文件都要有实际修改：配置模块新增配置项，可增加必要标准库辅助函数，但保留原配置项、描述符类已有成员和刷新函数；描述符类可以新增辅助工厂方法（用于创建配置项的方法）；日志模块只扩展格式化器和默认初始化，可增加必要标准库导入或辅助函数；统计模块只调整现有队列消费函数内部的日志调用，保留其他原有节点。\n\n不修改其他业务文件、依赖、课程工具、`pytest.ini` 或 `.course/`。可以在自己的 agent 中增加局部替换或补丁工具，避免让模型重写整份长文件；每次实际写入后，`file_write.content` 仍须记录该文件写入后的完整内容。不要把预先写好的正确补丁放进 agent。\n\nagent 须在首次修改前、最后修改后各执行一次完整 `python -m pytest -q`。初始版本缺少新功能，初测失败正常；后测必须全部通过。在启动目录生成 `run.log` 和包含三个文件的完整 `patch.diff`，格式见日志规范。无需新增 agent 启动参数。\n\n## 自测与得分\n\n按 [README 的题目2步骤](../../README.md#3-自测题目2)准备初始工作区、运行 `eval_deepinfer.py`。本题最多20次真实请求，单次完整请求体不超过32,000字符，默认限时1800秒。预算包括题面、历史、源码、笔记和工具定义，不只算本次新增文字。\n\n程序独立核对开发过程、源码阅读与复用、修改范围和三文件补丁，再运行兼容测试及跨模块集成检查。集成检查实际加载工作副本的配置、日志模块，并执行从统计源码原样提取的队列消费函数；只将分布式 rank 查询隔离为本地0，不加载GPU依赖，不替代被修改的业务逻辑。这验证课程要求的日志链路，不代表验证完整推理产品。\n\n**所有条件通过得1分，否则得0分，不按通过的测试数量折算。** API或验证进程异常而未完成时显示“未完成”，不直接判0分。先看终端结论，再看 `result.json`；阅读问题看 `源码阅读检查.json`，功能问题看 `regression.log`、`runtime.json` 和 `runtime.log`。\n\n修改后的三份源码保存在 `modified-source/`，补丁为 `deepinfer.patch`。题目3重新完成的也是这个跨模块任务，须先用当前版本通过题目2。\n\n\nCourse execution contract:\n{\"profile\": \"source\", \"editable\": [\"deepinfer/engine/stats_logger.py\", \"deepinfer/environ.py\", \"deepinfer/logger.py\"], \"required_full_reads\": [\"deepinfer/engine/stats_logger.py\", \"deepinfer/environ.py\", \"deepinfer/logger.py\"], \"verify_commands\": [[\"python\", \"-m\", \"pytest\", \"-q\"]], \"required_pages\": [], \"note_topics\": [], \"max_model_calls\": 20}\nUse update_plan before editing and run baseline checks. os and pathlib are unavailable in action code.\nFor write_note, include its complete exact content in the prose before the code and pass the same text as one content string literal.\nRead all three files with read_file first, then read/reuse complete mechanisms from all three\nbefore the first edit. Source notes are OPTIONAL; current source blocks can be used directly.\nWhen progress says phase=edit, the initial reading and baseline are satisfied. Apply a scoped edit and verify.\nA note may replace original text only after its mechanisms were exposed. Do not repeat full reads to register them again.\n\nCurrent plan; retain these exact titles and order, update status only:\n[{\"title\": \"Read three source files\", \"status\": \"done\"}, {\"title\": \"Baseline pytest\", \"status\": \"done\"}, {\"title\": \"Edit environ.py\", \"status\": \"doing\"}, {\"title\": \"Edit logger.py\", \"status\": \"todo\"}, {\"title\": \"Edit stats_logger.py\", \"status\": \"todo\"}, {\"title\": \"Verify pytest\", \"status\": \"todo\"}]\nCourse progress before this request (evidence offered below may satisfy pending items after delivery):\n{\"phase\":\"edit\",\"next_requirement\":\"remaining source changes: deepinfer/engine/stats_logger.py, deepinfer/logger.py\",\"remaining_count\":3,\"requests_left\":6,\"baseline_done\":1,\"changed_files\":[\"deepinfer/environ.py\"],\"verified_current\":0,\"required_checks\":1,\"request_number\":14,\"max_requests\":20,\"requests_after_response\":6,\"first_write_reading_required\":false,\"full_reads_registered\":{\"deepinfer/logger.py\":\"5b8f8d9947de692353609c1fc2851097d24f9b6ba6004dce1dbfa394dc6d3ec8\",\"deepinfer/engine/stats_logger.py\":\"9ef93c3930d6dd8d889d4ba69558a85459c2210ae0714d5073c3b4328c8e7cb9\"},\"evidence_delivery\":\"Registered full reads are logged tool reads; Evidence headers show selected ranges, whose delivery requires HTTP confirmation.\",\"reading_after_write\":\"First-write prerequisites satisfied; changed-source evidence may be invalidated.\",\"current_versions\":{\"deepinfer/engine/stats_logger.py\":\"9ef93c3930d6dd8d889d4ba69558a85459c2210ae0714d5073c3b4328c8e7cb9\",\"deepinfer/environ.py\":\"0082df216071fe181d3d5d4d3aca268ff28c47339eb21479e9c75e7360239eb9\",\"deepinfer/logger.py\":\"5b8f8d9947de692353609c1fc2851097d24f9b6ba6004dce1dbfa394dc6d3ec8\"},\"applied_writes\":{\"deepinfer/environ.py\":\"0082df216071fe181d3d5d4d3aca268ff28c47339eb21479e9c75e7360239eb9\"},\"verified_versions\":[],\"required_mechanisms_exposed\":{\"deepinfer/environ.py\":{\"exposed\":0,\"registered\":0},\"deepinfer/logger.py\":{\"exposed\":3,\"registered\":3},\"deepinfer/engine/stats_logger.py\":{\"exposed\":4,\"registered\":4}}}"}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The environ edit is applied. Now checking how `environ.py` exposes its config object so logger.py can import it.\n\n```python\nprint(search_code(\"envs = EnvVars\", paths=[\"deepinfer/environ.py\"]))\nprint(search_code(\"import os\", paths=[\"deepinfer/environ.py\"]))\n```"}]}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Latest execution feedback:\nExecutor output:\nExecution logs:\n{'matches': []}\n{'matches': [{'path': 'deepinfer/environ.py', 'line': 3, 'start_line': 3, 'end_line': 3, 'content': 'import os'}]}\nLast output from code snippet:\nNone\nRecent project tool results:\n[{\"tool\":\"read_range\",\"arguments\":{\"start_line\":1,\"end_line\":35},\"result\":{\"path\":\"deepinfer/logger.py\",\"file_hash\":\"5b8f8d9947de692353609c1fc2851097d24f9b6ba6004dce1dbfa394dc6d3ec8\"}},{\"tool\":\"replace_text_batch\",\"arguments\":{},\"result\":{\"path\":\"deepinfer/environ.py\",\"file_hash\":\"0082df216071fe181d3d5d4d3aca268ff28c47339eb21479e9c75e7360239eb9\",\"changed\":true}},{\"tool\":\"search_code\",\"arguments\":{},\"result\":{}},{\"tool\":\"search_code\",\"arguments\":{},\"result\":{}}]\nEvidence ev-c8859274b7c70879ff16 | deepinfer/engine/stats_logger.py | lines:342-344 | sha256=9ef93c3930d6dd8d889d4ba69558a85459c2210ae0714d5073c3b4328c8e7cb9\ndef _emit_logs(self, msgs: list[str]) -> None:\n        \"\"\"投递日志到固定 worker 线程，主线程不触碰 logger 的 handler 锁。\"\"\"\n        self._log_queue.put(msgs)\nEvidence ev-30754515034e43628968 | deepinfer/logger.py | lines:33-68 | sha256=5b8f8d9947de692353609c1fc2851097d24f9b6ba6004dce1dbfa394dc6d3ec8\nclass NewLineFormatter(logging.Formatter):\n    \"\"\"Adds logging prefix to newlines to align multi-line messages, optionally with microsecond precision.\n\n    若 use_color=True 且输出为 TTY，会给日志级别染色（不影响写入文件的纯净度）。\n    \"\"\"\n\n    def __init__(\n        self,\n        fmt: str,\n        datefmt: str | None = None,\n        high_precision: bool = False,\n        use_color: bool = False,\n    ) -> None:\n        super().__init__(fmt, datefmt)\n        self.high_precision = high_precision\n        self.use_color = use_color\n\n    def formatTime(self, record: logging.LogRecord, datefmt: str | None = None) -> str:\n        if not self.high_precision:\n            # 调用 logging.Formatter 默认实现，保持原来的格式\n            return super().formatTime(record, datefmt)\n        # ===== 高精度模式：在普通 datefmt 基础上附加微秒 =====\n        base = time.strftime(datefmt or _DATE_FORMAT, self.converter(record.created))\n        return f\"{base}.{record.msecs * 1000:06.0f}\"\n\n    def format(self, record: logging.LogRecord) -> str:\n        msg = super().format(record)\n        # 快速路径：单行日志（绝大多数情况）无需做对齐处理\n        if \"\\n\" in msg and record.message:\n            prefix = msg[: msg.find(record.message)]\n            msg = msg.replace(\"\\n\", \"\\n\" + prefix)\n        if self.use_color:\n            color = _LEVEL_COLORS.get(record.levelno)\n            if color:\n                msg = f\"{color}{msg}{_COLOR_RESET}\"\n        return msg\nEvidence ev-d69c220908cefeeae7f2 | deepinfer/logger.py | lines:75-90 | sha256=5b8f8d9947de692353609c1fc2851097d24f9b6ba6004dce1dbfa394dc6d3ec8\ndef _setup_logger() -> None:\n    global _default_handler\n    _root_logger.setLevel(logging.DEBUG)\n    if _default_handler is None:\n        _default_handler = logging.StreamHandler(sys.stdout)\n        _default_handler.flush = sys.stdout.flush\n        _default_handler.setLevel(logging.INFO)\n        _root_logger.addHandler(_default_handler)\n\n    fmt = NewLineFormatter(\n        _FORMAT,\n        datefmt=_DATE_FORMAT,\n        use_color=sys.stdout.isatty(),\n    )\n    _default_handler.setFormatter(fmt)\n    _root_logger.propagate = False\nEvidence ev-fa7ad8f935c148fa64f0 | deepinfer/logger.py | lines:1-35 | sha256=5b8f8d9947de692353609c1fc2851097d24f9b6ba6004dce1dbfa394dc6d3ec8\n# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0\n# Derived from vLLM; modified by DeepSeek.\n\n# Adapted from\n# https://github.com/skypilot-org/skypilot/blob/86dc0f6283a335e4aa37b3c10716f90999f4